<title>QATAR: TENNIS-QATAR OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QATAR OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from the</p>
<p>$635,000 Qatar Open tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeds):</p>
<p>Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Magnus Larssen (Sweden) beat 2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Herbert Wiltschnig (Austria) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>5-Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Jordi Burillo (Spain) 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Leander Paes (India) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Patrick McEnroe (U.S.) beat 7-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 6-4</p>
<p>1-6 6-2</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Dinu Pescariu (Romania) 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Tamy el-Sawy (Egypt) beat 3-Jan Simerink 6-3 6-7 (2-7) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
</text>
